","cells":[["200"]]},{"label":"Armor","cells":[["+2"]]},{"label":"Move Speed","cells":[["+50%"]]},{"label":"Might","cells":[["+50%"]]},{"label":"Greed","cells":[["+100%"]]},{"label":"Reroll","cells":[["+10"]]},{"label":"Skip","cells":[["+10"]]},{"label":"Banish","cells":[["+10"]]},{"label":"Charm","cells":[["50"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Elizabeth can be unlocking by evolving the ",{"i":"Sprite-Umbra.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:umbra"}," ",{"t":"Umbra","r":"weapon:umbra"},". She is then made available for purchase for ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 6,665, scaling with other characters purchased."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Elizabeth can be unlocked in the ",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"thelizardqueen\"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["She starts with +100 ",{"i":"Sprite-Max_Health.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"powerup:max-health"}," ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"},", +2 ",{"i":"Sprite-Armor.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:armor-stat"}," ",{"t":"Armor","r":"powerup:armor-stat"}," +50% ",{"i":"Sprite-Move_Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:move-speed"}," ",{"t":"Move Speed","r":"powerup:move-speed"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Might.png","w":18,"h":24,"r":"powerup:might"}," ",{"t":"Might","r":"powerup:might"},", +100% ",{"i":"Sprite-Greed.png","w":24,"h":20,"r":"powerup:greed"}," ",{"t":"Greed","r":"powerup:greed"}," +10 ",{"i":"Sprite-Reroll.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"powerup:reroll"}," ",{"t":"Rerolls","r":"powerup:reroll"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Banish.png","w":24,"h":21,"r":"powerup:banish"}," ",{"t":"Banishes","r":"powerup:banish"},", and ",{"i":"Sprite-Skip.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:skip"}," ",{"t":"Skips","r":"powerup:skip"},", and +50 ",{"i":"Sprite-Charm.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:charm"}," ",{"t":"Charm","r":"powerup:charm"}]},{"k":"p","c":["She also is immune to Health Drain."]},{"k":"p","c":["Elizabeth can find special Ode to Castlevania pickups from light sources."]},{"k":"p","c":["After acquiring the ",{"i":"Sprite-Ebony_and_Crimson_Stones.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"relic:ebony-and-crimson-stones"}," ",{"t":"Ebony and Crimson Stones","r":"relic:ebony-and-crimson-stones"},", at certain kill thresholds, starting at 1,000 kills, she morphs into a more powerful form, ",{"i":"Sprite-Megalo_Elizabeth_Bartley.png","w":24,"h":19,"r":"character:megalo-elizabeth-bartley"}," ",{"t":"Megalo Elizabeth Bartley","r":"character:megalo-elizabeth-bartley"},", for 30 seconds, similar to ",{"i":"Sprite-Menya_Moonspell.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:menya-moonspell"}," ",{"t":"Menya Moonspell","r":"character:menya-moonspell"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Impostor_Rina.png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"character:impostor-rina"}," ",{"t":"Impostor Rina","r":"character:impostor-rina"},". In this form, she gains +200% Might and -50% ",{"i":"Sprite-Cooldown.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:cooldown"}," ",{"t":"Cooldown","r":"powerup:cooldown"},", and becomes invulnerable. Kill thresholds are as follows:"]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["1,000 kills"]},{"c":["3,000 kills"]},{"c":["5,000 kills"]},{"c":["7,000 kills"]},{"c":["9,000 kills"]},{"c":["11,000 kills"]},{"c":["13,000 kills"]},{"c":["15,000 kills"]}]},{"k":"p","c":["After this, Elizabeth will continue to morph every 15,000 kills. A new morph will only begin once the current one has ended."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Items that increase ",{"i":"Sprite-Curse.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"powerup:curse"}," ",{"t":"Curse","r":"powerup:curse"}," or ",{"i":"Sprite-Charm.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:charm"}," ",{"t":"Charm","r":"powerup:charm"},", like ",{"i":"Sprite-Torrona's_Box.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:torrona-s-box"}," ",{"t":"Torrona's Box","r":"passive:torrona-s-box"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Karoma's_Mana.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:karoma-s-mana"}," ",{"t":"Karoma's Mana","r":"passive:karoma-s-mana"},", are important for Elizabeth in order to consistently kill as many enemies as possible. ",{"i":"Sprite-Wicked_Season_(XIII).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:wicked-season-xiii"}," ",{"t":"Wicked Season (XIII)","r":"arcana:wicked-season-xiii"}," is a good first Arcana. Built properly, Elizabeth can spend most of the run in her Megalo form."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Elizabeth_Bartley.png","w":102,"h":120,"c":["Elizabeth Bartley's sprite"]},{"i":"Animated-Elizabeth_Bartley.gif","w":102,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation"]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 1 December 2025 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Fixed Elizabeth not being able to transform again if reaching the next kill threshold while already transformed"]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 31 October 2024 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Her transforming into a Giant Medusa Head is a nod to Castlevania: Bloodines where she transforms into a new form resembling a gorgon."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"external-links","title":"External links","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"t":"Elizabeth Bartley","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Elizabeth_Bartley"}," in the ",{"t":" Castlevania Wiki","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/"}]}]}],"subs":[]}]}